    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-301174cb-a232-401e-8683-d820eb34da7b" n="0759" facs="#m-988abf46-5a02-43c5-8dc4-c4d6d1c23235" /><div xml:id="m-6d490d28-d90d-4afa-a62a-9c6fc6687698">
            <lg xml:id="m-a59e52c9-22a7-4d54-9390-67006edb74a0">
              <l xml:id="m-5529371b-3ffa-4015-963a-6167a368ef51" facs="#m-0dfb7d6f-3ed5-4c91-9cce-8315256dad38" label="ambiguous">Tuesday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-7f5f66ce-3b66-4a87-96bb-5c1500886114" facs="#m-abbe4c56-852b-4bf4-8fb5-95c0fd8bdafe" label="ambiguous">613</l><l xml:id="m-941585d4-2cec-479a-9107-86031fd3b5ea" facs="#m-e7b22ae3-712d-4642-a6e7-0fc8b4ec49e3" label="lyrics-like">trus verbi, quod dixerat ei totam cohórtem, et induunt eum</l><l xml:id="m-39ba619a-c87a-420a-a0a0-11bc7005f30e" facs="#m-9944cce6-5634-431e-b4c5-8d452d38cef4" label="lyrics-like">Jesus: Priúsquam gallus cantet</l><l xml:id="m-3a8194d3-a53b-4c53-960d-c3de9b98ed9a" facs="#m-2526013e-c43c-40ae-b50d-e92b99b5e281" label="lyrics-like">púrpura, et impónunt ei ple¬</l><l xml:id="m-37c1a9e9-7e81-4322-a6b0-dfb7363d3064" facs="#m-d53762a0-e049-4869-bb4c-63659baec492" label="lyrics-like">cténtes spineam corónam. Et</l><l xml:id="m-d5f95729-c561-4658-bf13-a1c6005e7bf3" facs="#m-94560d04-445c-4dc0-bada-d942966059eb" label="lyrics-like">bis, ter me negábis. Et cœpit</l><l xml:id="m-eca8f9cd-642f-4a75-9d2b-88c8c52818d9" facs="#m-5c12caf0-f555-4001-b114-227b16a3e87b" label="ambiguous">flere.</l><l xml:id="m-34cfbda6-26e7-474f-a136-46275602fdb9" facs="#m-ff8d1671-4efc-46fd-a7e3-175f85672d25" label="lyrics-like">cœpérunt salutáre eum: Ave,</l><l xml:id="m-c407a933-0f74-490b-8f28-af6c8af04c64" facs="#m-01e5f13f-449b-4490-846d-e2b3ae321af7" label="lyrics-like">Et conféstim mane consslium</l><l xml:id="m-c38297b1-5dd5-4b6e-b941-da39ff6a57f6" facs="#m-c5e8f701-c510-4ea3-958a-ad93cc1d1c45" label="lyrics-like">Rex Judacórum. Et percutiébant</l><l xml:id="m-5ab55cb1-c4b7-4f9c-9e63-cb20c8d842b1" facs="#m-1009e10b-70eb-4ea0-8055-5709d4b69d88" label="lyrics-like">faciéntes summi sacerdótes,</l><l xml:id="m-44d7a9d8-0f02-4915-b246-39b9fb89ed2d" facs="#m-2fe75cc5-8bf9-494a-aa33-2f32b8043f12" label="lyrics-like">caput ejus arúndine : et conspué¬</l><l xml:id="m-75d39ff1-ab51-42a4-bd1d-ff1ba0f4af6c" facs="#m-6f61aaba-003e-41fc-b054-7bad2c3cd1fd" label="lyrics-like">cum senióribus, et scribis, et</l><l xml:id="m-f2abc787-7eca-48cc-8dd8-db9149d866b6" facs="#m-716d7c73-e877-4299-a79f-5f1f98285a18" label="lyrics-like">bant eum, et ponéntes génua,</l><l xml:id="m-c324e04a-e126-42f9-bbb1-f9be9311eb13" facs="#m-76badd3e-41d7-452e-b5fb-2a931d29d6c0" label="lyrics-like">univérso concilio, vinciéntes Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-44c17c38-c0a1-453a-afde-9144b9b15b6b" facs="#m-5b6f385a-9324-4ec9-a845-68ec0be2df02" label="lyrics-like">adorábant eum. Et postquam</l><l xml:id="m-7989d9c7-4c6a-4810-ae67-37a49d2a3faa" facs="#m-6fe7f8cd-0932-4532-ba18-cf422d7a212a" label="lyrics-like">illusérunt ei, exuérunt illum púr¬</l><l xml:id="m-bbd10f58-48f1-475c-8ee8-f74e702cb369" facs="#m-7a1bea6b-08d2-4dfa-af38-b80c1a939988" label="lyrics-like">sum, duxérunt, et tradidérunt</l><l xml:id="m-2576c542-2c71-4897-b620-2f1dff848e97" facs="#m-2cce0233-9f34-478d-8b64-785f5b049643" label="lyrics-like">Piláto. Et interrogávit eum Pilá¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a92c7b7-2606-4447-ba96-2216dfc606d5" facs="#m-c8584a7d-a7de-41ea-b55e-7480aabd2186" label="lyrics-like">pura, et induérunt eum vesti¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee2177fb-ee65-4a78-9995-6af7181b66d5" facs="#m-788c358b-a5de-41b3-85d6-5ba65becd8df" label="lyrics-like">méntis suis: et edúcunt illum,</l><l xml:id="m-2ab16ab7-c5cf-4fa4-adf9-a346d42f82fb" facs="#m-757b0c20-cb2c-4efe-b7ce-c85772309022" label="lyrics-like">tus: S. Tu es Rex Judacórum?</l><l xml:id="m-2fd91ed0-3fea-48a6-910c-8c6fe470fdfa" facs="#m-84044ed7-8a52-471c-ac19-5fcf5221e614" label="lyrics-like">C. At ille respóndens, ait illi:</l><l xml:id="m-4cff0fa0-5575-44d2-91ac-cfd19a3fc370" facs="#m-6824d9b1-99cc-489e-ae38-4f7b533cd30f" label="lyrics-like">ut crucifígerent eum. Et anga¬</l><l xml:id="m-2466ba8e-19f9-4d9d-9067-3bed6ff62ffe" facs="#m-622eb670-0a53-4b7a-964b-3fc721bec8a5" label="lyrics-like">Tu dicis. C. Et accusábant</l><l xml:id="m-75198000-e1ea-45e3-9c3d-0cac6ca52f3c" facs="#m-6ff81b14-1dfa-4842-aaf2-69dc3afb5988" label="lyrics-like">riavérunt praetereúntem quém¬</l><l xml:id="m-153f18c6-f9d4-4394-9399-2ebce6e4dfde" facs="#m-43f47198-975b-4c7d-8aae-f6d13c2322b9" label="lyrics-like">piam, Simónem Cyrenaéum, ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb4171f7-268a-4e9c-8040-62fcd002396c" facs="#m-2a413f98-98a7-4a97-92ef-6f7aeac16d68" label="lyrics-like">eum summi sacerdótes in multis.</l><l xml:id="m-e754ae6d-9102-4b56-8bfc-3f4da8e2874c" facs="#m-2849bc35-95b7-40f7-9b9c-c5a94221de39" label="lyrics-like">gilátus autem rursum interro¬</l><l xml:id="m-7170e47c-b7f0-464b-9271-8a260246b37c" facs="#m-236c11bf-3484-4084-9594-7c5c626896d3" label="lyrics-like">niéntem de villa, patrem Ale¬</l><l xml:id="m-66fc97f1-747f-4304-b90c-f0b4deabbd7b" facs="#m-480c4c0f-1e5d-42bf-9940-f3a4cd6cee72" label="lyrics-like">Pávit eum, dicens: S. Non</l><l xml:id="m-d3d9768c-7263-4257-b2bf-53b3040ea1f3" facs="#m-e3ceb4e2-08d8-44ae-bfa4-c396270bb0c2" label="lyrics-like">xándri et Rufi, ut tólleret cru¬</l><l xml:id="m-5f189b90-34f7-45f2-921d-3e8ad09518e2" facs="#m-0b4c1b81-d00d-4df2-8986-ac5594a058ac" label="lyrics-like">respóndes quidquam? vide in</l><l xml:id="m-0fcece09-16b2-4d71-bc7e-b85d6f8e6b55" facs="#m-1365bf16-0235-4ee9-bdb9-980e8428196b" label="ambiguous">cem ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-815358e9-a6f4-4282-a711-24a3e4744f65" facs="#m-efebee5a-c1a5-46f3-922b-250f7f579a30" label="lyrics-like">Et perdúcunt illum in Gólgo¬</l><l xml:id="m-752c09a7-3253-4762-8387-10f9bf21ff24" facs="#m-1f7ce054-68d6-4b2d-92bd-ca0f55ff853c" label="lyrics-like">quantis te accúsant. C. Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-bfd6c2fc-424f-42dc-ab35-1d31a30aa56a" facs="#m-fa5b9079-7e29-4c1d-b227-a1dbce2460d7" label="lyrics-like">tha locum, quod est interpretá¬</l><l xml:id="m-e33b2f96-1cb3-49a6-9881-c05a1073ed20" facs="#m-744dde9c-5841-4b7c-9bc7-d644b5f40e7a" label="lyrics-like">autem ámplius nihil respóndit,</l><l xml:id="m-3b5bff2c-9ef1-45e5-8d0c-660476b21e67" facs="#m-6731c66f-6af2-4a83-8b64-da13788a2446" label="lyrics-like">ita ut mirarétur Pilátus.</l><l xml:id="m-2f75a85b-1355-44f5-ad05-9dc7bf652efb" facs="#m-b9e51ec7-06a5-4bbb-bd49-580c877c6c59" label="lyrics-like">tum Calváriae locus. Et dabant</l><l xml:id="m-b3944ba8-f62b-4bde-8296-15d452550812" facs="#m-c5adca65-89dc-4345-9fb8-d328252a1fb6" label="lyrics-like">Per diem autem festum solébat</l><l xml:id="m-3fa35630-753e-4a5b-8f70-dbee613c6c64" facs="#m-c902280b-9d8a-4c75-a03b-614559f904db" label="lyrics-like">ei bibere myrrhátum vinum</l><l xml:id="m-783c66ac-ef25-4630-a185-092388efb176" facs="#m-bfa21217-885b-42fa-8ade-52b06dd46458" label="ambiguous">dimittere illis unum ex vinctis,</l><l xml:id="m-5d30908b-c212-4327-9aed-4020b027bb56" facs="#m-10424f1e-f771-4752-87a5-00e2efd1aba7" label="lyrics-like">et non accépit. Et crucifigéntes</l><l xml:id="m-457b5b56-0112-41e4-86c4-1d2f356bc983" facs="#m-aefa4a0b-1f46-4aa4-b494-31a0edb65454" label="lyrics-like">quemcúmque petiissent. Erat</l><l xml:id="m-7d56ba66-bfb4-4761-90dc-0ce27c0d48ba" facs="#m-a3d40f6b-2c97-415d-a400-cbdccdbbdbe6" label="lyrics-like">eum, divisérunt vestiménta ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-e9c3a1f0-2520-44c8-a299-20e6f0b8487d" facs="#m-9aed03df-9eb2-4435-a849-b402db912f71" label="lyrics-like">autem qui dicebátur Barábbas,</l><l xml:id="m-6cfa586e-a453-44ba-8f6a-bec6a74b2a0e" facs="#m-b14a460b-0291-4a1f-becc-9c01400c66b0" label="lyrics-like">mitténtes sortem super eis, quis</l><l xml:id="m-19eb92fc-0da5-4ad3-b0bf-639ef34fde94" facs="#m-f6826d32-9d57-4531-93ea-d43ab2c7359d" label="lyrics-like">quid tólleret. Erat autem hora</l><l xml:id="m-86e55ffe-4a93-49fb-8843-106b1c670e7d" facs="#m-c6a6b7fd-16ad-4bf8-a7d5-603e52e1ee4c" label="lyrics-like">qui cum seditiósis erat vinctus,</l><l xml:id="m-aff817e8-500b-4f57-8222-d8003ed20685" facs="#m-eef85e2f-8d7a-49d3-8f02-4083f057cd2b" label="lyrics-like">tértia: et crucifixérunt eum.</l><l xml:id="m-d13c1b77-5631-4be7-ad87-6a88d307ab1e" facs="#m-1a836872-cc8d-4749-98ac-f73cf47cd8be" label="lyrics-like">qui in seditióne fécerat homici¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab14dd0b-f5b1-4236-ba52-a723862921e5" facs="#m-32ad36fd-bb25-4d20-8e71-6b94c4d0c35c" label="lyrics-like">Et erat títulus causae ejus in¬</l><l xml:id="m-c02b871a-4c1d-4248-adaa-59be69e0894c" facs="#m-8e79d713-b31b-48ae-bd08-723ca2641051" label="ambiguous">dium. Et cum ascendisset turba,</l><l xml:id="m-04483b1e-251c-4500-bd5a-569ff86f0257" facs="#m-50b65f9c-1541-4c5c-adc8-df8362a6c3ea" label="lyrics-like">cœpit rogáre, sicut semper fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-549c8d30-ef41-4108-ab35-0bb8f9ee75e6" facs="#m-53b32a1d-a443-4b0b-9b12-a48d644668e1" label="lyrics-like">scríptus: Rex Judacórum. Et</l><l xml:id="m-f7bdc557-afdd-4f61-bcc2-5bf4f28125dc" facs="#m-841b0334-d5bd-4e11-ac77-0c343cb26ce0" label="lyrics-like">ciébat ilis. Pilátus autem re¬</l><l xml:id="m-478dc115-e215-4406-92de-f83a98157f84" facs="#m-6373562c-421c-4fac-83f4-927a5b0a58fa" label="lyrics-like">cum eo crucifigunt duos latró¬</l><l xml:id="m-7c9901f3-2112-4bc8-916d-baa48a122ab2" facs="#m-76f9f719-98f5-43c3-89b6-8ad267913dd5" label="lyrics-like">spóndit eis, et dixit : S. Vultis</l><l xml:id="m-552df6a9-cbeb-4e8b-a4d8-3adb18848743" facs="#m-7d37c45b-a5a5-4c8a-8307-453d10e67c79" label="lyrics-like">nes: unum a dextris, et álium</l><l xml:id="m-e6f30873-af93-40a8-abb0-b242fe0d0c5a" facs="#m-6e20941f-7bed-442c-bc84-f8663e1ef084" label="lyrics-like">a sinistris ejus. Et impléta est</l><l xml:id="m-5ba27c76-d7ae-4734-b19d-c98cb61d105e" facs="#m-58cd00e7-c4e2-49c0-bf70-a7ba469488dc" label="lyrics-like">dimittam vobis Regem Judacó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0092395-03c5-4c5b-9449-6ece841993ce" facs="#m-d6d5e18b-96d0-42ff-9d0e-9bfe30f2ad25" label="lyrics-like">Scriptúra, quae dicit : Et cum</l><l xml:id="m-bab67023-31b3-491d-981d-b1bc50df99af" facs="#m-19902128-d96c-4f58-8089-0bfc67f9876d" label="lyrics-like">rum? C. Sciébat enim quod per</l><l xml:id="m-2062ca89-36a4-48cd-845d-c92fe53fff11" facs="#m-0f2f6873-9c2c-40e0-ba14-ce810aac0450" label="lyrics-like">iniquis reputátus est. Et prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4acb05b-f290-442c-852f-bc683eaf7c2a" facs="#m-a439f615-a295-4c3d-80d5-ba0a7ce6e2c2" label="lyrics-like">invídiam tradidíssent eum sum¬</l><l xml:id="m-004870c8-a0d3-4666-826a-641764760611" facs="#m-47f26061-98ff-4b61-9573-55bcd7b0277d" label="lyrics-like">tereúntes blasphemábant eum,</l><l xml:id="m-eefc95e5-e361-4c53-bba6-ad99fbb49a1d" facs="#m-e2e41975-5932-4830-abb9-a8ec808226ff" label="lyrics-like">mi sacerdótes. Pontífices autem</l><l xml:id="m-212b8cec-877b-4d07-99ee-9f9d4dbad3b1" facs="#m-31b006ce-c81e-4cd2-8927-909ccd9eb2d6" label="lyrics-like">movéntes cápita sua, et dicén¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9333963-83c5-414b-bd45-3a52e2eaa944" facs="#m-bd5b2af0-01f7-4b51-b1f5-713c8e6c83c5" label="lyrics-like">concitavérunt turbam, ut magis</l><l xml:id="m-236b9ba5-ad4a-4c68-9a05-fd8b4a857f03" facs="#m-b9ecaac6-bfa3-451a-914f-ccd57038e107" label="lyrics-like">tes: S. Vah, qui déstruis tem¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7f9d702-a4db-420f-ac32-bebc930f0ad3" facs="#m-430b2ba9-6539-4cfc-bbd5-717c3b06bc9c" label="lyrics-like">Barábbam dimitteret eis. Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-d56d93b2-3670-4d3c-b260-74bf962e2aee" facs="#m-15e65cda-0b12-4c44-817f-bab2d66a8f39" label="lyrics-like">plum Dei, et in tribus diébus</l><l xml:id="m-6d7ef974-d1fc-440b-acf3-89f823f72d7d" facs="#m-412023e6-0778-4e42-a489-dfc5d149ab43" label="lyrics-like">autem iterum respóndens, ait</l><l xml:id="m-6c5b5dcc-f8ba-4b6c-9f15-0079adbb8911" facs="#m-9c4839c1-60e3-41e0-acba-eccffc4e1c8e" label="lyrics-like">illis : S. Quid ergo vultis fáciam</l><l xml:id="m-f647913e-a19a-4cce-9bca-d4b471394462" facs="#m-ee506f6d-88b0-41c6-bb0d-78da1e14c20d" label="lyrics-like">reaedíficas: salvum fac temet¬</l><l xml:id="m-e40371c8-ce9b-4c0c-b035-541018973d5a" facs="#m-5f34987b-10bf-4bcc-8b29-92897098d472" label="lyrics-like">Regi Judacórum? C. At illi</l><l xml:id="m-046ee597-2515-4872-b8bb-65fa3d8a9095" facs="#m-813049dc-bf54-4922-8fa2-ffe7e76fce57" label="lyrics-like">ipsum, descéndens de cruce.</l><l xml:id="m-7f5e5a4b-ceab-4d0a-a117-8484d3b6bb42" facs="#m-fab8b5c6-2d3b-4f74-8b65-53f61d397914" label="lyrics-like">C. Similiter et summi sacerdótes</l><l xml:id="m-04be5738-eebe-461c-b202-93f78e0c6d58" facs="#m-93033520-2adc-4e75-a65d-b853b4a25f01" label="lyrics-like">Iterum clamavérunt: S. Cruci¬</l><l xml:id="m-05c2e2ca-a420-4878-8e58-4548d772df88" facs="#m-4b6d226e-01c1-4aeb-b3f4-b6469e87ae2b" label="lyrics-like">illudéntes, ad altérutrum cum</l><l xml:id="m-a79a2c43-6b72-4817-8246-9c53c0bd9566" facs="#m-7832be94-2324-4e3b-a1c0-8fcf7c98bf3f" label="lyrics-like">fige eum. C. Pilátus vero dicébat</l><l xml:id="m-b5332e37-93b7-40fd-8e5d-5ecd49ec7197" facs="#m-33008198-f8ac-470f-a88f-21cecb7f14eb" label="lyrics-like">scribis dicébant : S. Alios salvos</l><l xml:id="m-db004ab1-d3b9-4246-b669-795e7251b88a" facs="#m-e355b22d-091c-4c03-be64-f79fe41ef80b" label="ambiguous">illis: S. Quid enim mali fecit?</l><l xml:id="m-7760648c-c72e-462b-9b3a-f6841b399959" facs="#m-f57db3c3-c85a-4076-b623-c8d8a27a87df" label="lyrics-like">C. At illi magis clamábant:</l><l xml:id="m-56462861-4fad-4f93-8969-514becdd06e8" facs="#m-c28803ab-39d5-4e70-9faa-bc612c2f0f87" label="lyrics-like">fecit, seípsum non potest salvum</l><l xml:id="m-251abe37-2438-4547-9332-af7ae9d7fae2" facs="#m-69e32177-8641-4e06-97fb-9c161547b26a" label="lyrics-like">5. Crucifige eum. C. Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-4fb0750f-e2f5-4e2b-a938-6537f1208771" facs="#m-b3989438-e9eb-4f2e-a97a-55d5f3528dc5" label="lyrics-like">fácere. Christus Rex Israël de¬</l><l xml:id="m-46884f6a-c0fa-4348-8287-7222e61eddd8" facs="#m-5a9caed9-5630-4fa7-887d-8e90e8f5b97a" label="lyrics-like">autem volens pópulo satisfácere,</l><l xml:id="m-cdfcfe5a-6433-49ff-b003-5481757e2f73" facs="#m-028d9448-1c4e-4a20-a3ce-87db87dfa00c" label="lyrics-like">scéndat nunc de cruce, ut videá¬</l><l xml:id="m-38dff4b9-d32b-499d-9ee4-b3592a3256f5" facs="#m-316c29e8-93d1-4da2-b066-28f4c79c4277" label="lyrics-like">dimuísit illis Barábbam, et trá¬</l><l xml:id="m-92085250-6567-4ceb-ada3-bc0633911e68" facs="#m-ead0f185-3f84-418e-868f-070bab896b87" label="lyrics-like">mus, et credámus. C. Et qui</l><l xml:id="m-42409d2d-c88f-48ed-8ea6-8a5c69b4842a" facs="#m-ae596039-53b1-4dfc-a159-8846ac9f625c" label="lyrics-like">didit Jesum flagéllis caesum, ut</l><l xml:id="m-49bf9a40-d2bf-4932-91ba-147a9b236943" facs="#m-0b895f1d-d1f4-4e1f-b551-6bcc14f751c8" label="ambiguous">cum eo crucifixi erant convi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8e81cc31-ec10-4560-8833-d4aadd2b34b5" facs="#m-7e72b4f5-c3f2-457f-a156-a73123bdb4e0" label="lyrics-like">crucifigerétur.</l><l xml:id="m-d387a51e-19d1-4670-81fb-96b3d246c4e4" facs="#m-41444043-c94c-4231-9827-5eedec2c02ce" label="lyrics-like">tiabántur ei. Et facta hora sexta,</l><l xml:id="m-bd7e08a4-f8ad-444b-b64e-943a9e30d2e2" facs="#m-2776ca7f-fd4c-47b8-b2fc-5f13a88e44b7" label="lyrics-like">Milites autem duxérunt eum</l><l xml:id="m-7c98838c-0a40-4365-aefa-2777bb008d9d" facs="#m-c8b82be6-5536-4132-bedd-d72a9d4a6fee" label="lyrics-like">ténebrae factae sunt per totam</l><l xml:id="m-570ff1c4-57ef-4219-bb89-6797cd5cd526" facs="#m-cc12e539-3ba2-4e6a-aa84-db69fe5b782b" label="lyrics-like">in átrium praetórii, et cónvocant! terram, usque in horam nonam.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>